{
    "title": "Nipto: Split Household Chores",
    "description": "Nipto organizes a game in your couple, your family or your roommate to better divide the household chores.\r\n\r\nBy doing these household chores and home cleaning tasks, players accumulate points throughout the week. The winner is chosen every Sunday evening and can get a reward. The counters are then reset and a new week of competition begins.\r\n\r\nNipto also involves your children, whose accounts you can manage and customize the points goal.\r\n\r\nCompetition for some, teamwork for others, Nipto makes sharing household chores and home cleaning fun and friendly. No more debates about who does the most housework! \r\n\r\nYou will also be able to : \r\n- Personalize household chores,\r\n- Choose your favourite game mode, competition or personal goal,\r\n- See the participation of each player,\r\n- Reward the winners,\r\n- Add reminders for important household chores,\r\n- Offering a bonus of points as a thank you.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Nipto organizes a game in your couple, your family or your roommate to better divide the household chores.<br><br>By doing these household chores and home cleaning tasks, players accumulate points throughout the week. The winner is chosen every Sunday evening and can get a reward. The counters are then reset and a new week of competition begins.<br><br>Nipto also involves your children, whose accounts you can manage and customize the points goal.<br><br>Competition for some, teamwork for others, Nipto makes sharing household chores and home cleaning fun and friendly. No more debates about who does the most housework! <br><br>You will also be able to : <br>- Personalize household chores,<br>- Choose your favourite game mode, competition or personal goal,<br>- See the participation of each player,<br>- Reward the winners,<br>- Add reminders for important household chores,<br>- Offering a bonus of points as a thank you.",
